// DEF-ADDSEG regression: a single flat 1000-term addition over
// format() bindings (the construction B-lit section 11.6 had to
// work around by spot-checking a1/a500/a1000). The left-leaning
// chain this parses to made SA text codegen recurse one genExpr
// frame per term and overflow the compiler stack (rc=139/134) at
// a few hundred terms; genExpr's binary fallback now folds the
// left spine iteratively. Fails pre-fix (stack overflow abort),
// passes post-fix on both backends.
@import "sa_std/string.sa"

